# Bootstrap tooling and local scratch, superseded by this library.
# did.txt in a repo proves nothing — anyone can write a DID into a file.
# The link between this repo and its author is the signed message in the
# README, which only the holder of that key could have produced.
did.txt
flop-did-create.cjs
flop-post.cjs

